OL,3,GNEWSAGuide dog puppies taken on cave
OL,4,Atraining trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrainee guide dogs have been taken to
OL,7,Fan underground tourist attraction to
OL,8,Fhelp them get used to unfamiliar
OL,9,Fsurroundings.
OL,11,FVolunteer puppy raisers used Wookey
OL,12,FHole Caves in Somerset to get used to
OL,13,Fnew sights, sounds and smells to help
OL,14,Fprepare them for life as working dogs
OL,15,Fin the future.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
