OL,3,GNEWSAGuide dog puppies taken on cave
OL,4,Atraining trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy Avery, puppy development advisor
OL,7,Ffor Somerset at Guide Dogs, said: "It's
OL,8,Fbrilliant training for the dogs.
OL,9,FThere's different surfaces and
OL,10,Ftemperatures and suddenly going from
OL,11,Flight to darker and the echo. It's
OL,12,Factual experience for the puppies for
OL,13,Fwhen they become an actual guide dog.
OL,15,F"Dogs learn more when they are younger
OL,16,Fand can gain positive experiences from
OL,17,Fthese situations to helping others."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
